# Copy this file when starting a new dialogue scene.
#
# Quick rules:
# - Comments start with #.
# - Blank lines are ignored.
# - Use lowercase cast keys in dialogue and commands.
# - none: writes narration with no speaker name.
# - Sprite paths resolve as:
#   res://sprites/character/[folder]/scene_sprites/[file].png
# - Missing sprites warn and fall back to the default portrait.
# - Full manual:
#   res://notes/cutscene_authoring_manual.md

@cast
# key = Display Name | Title | Folder | alias:file, alias:file
# Title, folder, and aliases may be omitted.
remilia = Remilia Scarlet | Tepes' Strongest Soldier | remilia | neutral:th1
patchouli = Patchouli Knowledge | Pizzamancer | patchouli | neutral:th2

@scene
# Portrait commands:
# enter speaker position
# show speaker at position
# exit speaker left/right
# hide speaker
# swap speaker sprite_alias
#
# Animation commands:
# anim speaker slide position
# anim speaker shake/hop/double_hop/interact/toggle_fade/question
#
# Focus/effect shortcuts:
# dim speaker
# normal speaker
# focus speaker
# effect speaker portrait-sil/portrait-normal/dim/zoom/teleport position
# effect all portrait-sil/portrait-normal/dim/zoom/teleport position
# effect loud/quiet
#
# Other commands:
# sfx surprise
# bg none
# bg res://path/to/background.png
#
# with/end:
# - Put dialogue inside the block to attach commands to that dialogue beat.
# - Leave dialogue outside the block to make the block happen first.

with
	enter patchouli left 0.5
	effect patchouli loud
	patchouli: Good news everyone.
end

with
	slide patchouli 0.25
	enter remilia 0.75
end

with
	focus remilia
	anim remilia question
	remilia: :pregnant_mandrew:
end

with
	focus patchouli
	patchouli: No, no. Far too early for that.
end
	patchouli: As you can see, the cutscene scripting has been polished up quite a bit.
	patchouli: It's incredibly fluid now to conduct and write them.

with
	focus remilia
	remilia: It does feel easier to speak and act on our 2 dimensional existence.
end

with
	focus patchouli
	anim patchouli hop
	patchouli: Mukyuu
end

patchouli: So thanks for comin' folks.
exit patchouli left

none:

with
	focus remilia
	slide remilia 0.5
end

remilia: It's another wonderful Sakuya Sunday.
anim remilia toggle_fade
